# review transcripts and screenshots, and spike run outputs.
docs/research/raw/
docs/reviews/*-codex.md
docs/reviews/*.diff
docs/reviews/round1-fresh.md
docs/reviews/round1-fresh-shots/
docs/reviews/*-fresh.md
docs/reviews/*-fresh-shots/
docs/spikes/corpus/baseline-*.txt
docs/spikes/*/results-raw.txt
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
